  "authorized_dimension_changes": "Author confirmed manual repetition for each dimension. The 8D call, two sample-count thresholds, filename and timing label are parameterized for 3\u201310D, preserving the original d+1 hull threshold. Table regressions repeat for the same dimensions.",
  "path_changes": "Generic paths in pipeline/paths.py; generated pickle reads moved from raw-data locations to their producers\u2019 result locations. Additional outputs are isolated under results/additional.",
  "extraction_changes": "Original calculation lines retained; imports and intermediate file loads added for independent stages. Participant-specific undefined plotting block (1_length_semsim_vars.py:657\u2013710) omitted. Final interactive diagnostics omitted from core feature producers. Duplicate 9D calculation removed; identical pure text helper bodies shared.",
  "approved_corrections": [
    "Figure S1: FDR-BH replaced by Bonferroni as confirmed by the author and supplementary material.",
    "Symptoms: numeric-only correlation matrices; dummy encoding of string groups in partial-correlation p-values, consistent with the supplied coefficient calculation.",
    "Sentence centroid: convert pooled PyTorch embeddings with .detach().cpu().numpy() before the unchanged NumPy centroid, cosine-dispersion and Euclidean-distance formulas; explicitly approved by the author."
  ],
  "figure_io_changes": "Existing commented savefig calls in the length/similarity plots activated; independent canvases for figure panels; distinct filenames for the average-sentence-length diagnostics. No plotted quantities changed.",
  "omitted_redundant_sections": [
    "51_tables_results.py:305\u2013422 repeated mixed-model calls and manually pasted terminal-output export; live computation/export retained in pipeline/08_semantic_regression.py."
  ],
